Release notes for balrogg. See ChangeLog for source-level changes.

v1.0 (03-09-2026)
- First release.
- Lossless Ogg Vorbis recompression with adaptive context models and CM for
  residue data. Levels -5 and above store per-file parameters
  without increasing decode time.
- Lossless Ogg Opus recompression using a parser derived from libopus. Each
  entropy-coded symbol uses its original probability table as a prior.
- Whole-bitstream and header-page deduplication for chained Vorbis files.
